OL,3,GNEWSABarn owls breed at hall for first
OL,4,Atime in decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to improve the parkland around a
OL,7,FDerbyshire country home for barn owls
OL,8,Fhas seen a pair breed for the first
OL,9,Ftime in two decades.
OL,11,FA pair of the protected species of owls
OL,12,Fhas successfully reared four young this
OL,13,Fsummer at Kedleston Hall near Derby.
OL,15,FThe National Trust said the owlets were
OL,16,Fa result of nest box installations and
OL,17,Fcareful management of their habitats to
OL,18,Fboost the population of small mammals
OL,19,Fto provide enough food.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
