OL,3,GNEWSABarn owls breed at hall for first
OL,4,Atime in decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FCountryside manager Tom Dunne said:
OL,7,F"It's been a really exciting year for
OL,8,Fus. This is the first time that we've
OL,9,Fhad a successful nest fledged with
OL,10,Fchicks, they've reared their chicks
OL,11,Ffully and they've flown off out into
OL,12,Fthe landscape."
